    """Friendly builder for a part (issue #27): ``Part('S')``.

    ``kind='usage'`` (default) or ``kind='definition'`` selects the SysML
    form at creation: ``Part('S')`` -> ``part S;``,
    ``Part('S', kind='definition')`` -> ``part def S;``.
    """


